@HostAddress = http://localhost:5080

### Sprite Asset (bundled → cache → downloaded once)
GET {{HostAddress}}/assets/sprites/versions/generation-iii/ruby-sapphire/25.png

### Cry Asset
GET {{HostAddress}}/assets/cries/latest/25.ogg

### Battle background Asset
GET {{HostAddress}}/assets/battle/fx/bg-forest.png

### Music Asset
GET {{HostAddress}}/assets/music/bw-trainer.mp3

### Sign in as the admin first (Accounts/Http/Account.http → Login Account)

### Download AssetAdmin (each item is a fallback chain)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/assets/download
Content-Type: application/json
X-LivingDex: 1

{
  "items": [
    ["sprites/other/home/10033.png", "sprites/10033.png"],
    ["cries/latest/1.ogg"]
  ]
}

### Status AssetAdmin
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/assets/status

### Cancel AssetAdmin
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/admin/assets/cancel
X-LivingDex: 1
